    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:haggadah:magid/u_v_mora_gadol">
        <tei:milestone unit="paragraph" n="1" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:haggadah:magid/u_v_mora_gadol/1"/>
        <tei:p>“with great fearsomeness:” This refers to the revelation of the divine presence, as scripture relates: “Has any god endeavored to take a nation for himself from within the midst of another nation, with trials, with signs and wonders, with war, with a strong hand and an outstretched arm, and with displays of great fearsomeness, like all that Adonai, your God, did for you in Egypt before your eyes?”[30] Deut. 4:34</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
